<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Melo wordmark built on the exact Threads (Barcelona) construction:
  every part of the mark is a stroked path revealed with trimPathEnd,
  one stroke per target, 15 targets in reading order.

  Left  : Melo wave-sticks logo (6 capsule bars + dot)
  Right : "Melo" lettering in the Threads wordmark style —
          butt-capped strokes, same stroke weights, same ~10° stem slant,
          and the "e" is Meta's actual Threads "e" path (translated).

  Stroke widths, slant and letter proportions are taken from the original
  barcelona_wordmark_launch_vector.xml so the text reads as the same hand.
  Meta's per-stroke clip-paths are intentionally omitted: they are tuned to
  their exact glyph geometry and, on these letterforms, mask the stroke away.
-->
